  "notes": "{加|くわ}える is an ichidan verb meaning to add or append.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{加|くわ}わる→加わる：01940_kuwawaru⟧ (intransitive - to join, be added)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- A⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧B⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{加|くわ}える: to add B to A\n- ⟦{説明|せつめい}→説明：01449_setsumei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{加|くわ}える: to add an explanation\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{変更|へんこう}→変更：03616_henkou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{加|くわ}える: to make changes\n- ⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{加|くわ}える: to modify, work on\n- ⟦{攻撃|こうげき}→攻撃：02748_kougeki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{加|くわ}える: to attack (inflict an attack)\n- ⟦{危害|きがい}→危害：19386_kigai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{加|くわ}える: to harm\n\nWATCH OUT:\n- {加|くわ}える: to add\n- ⟦{咥|くわ}える→咥える：02053_kuwaeru⟧: to hold in mouth (different kanji and meaning)",
